Subject: image: the run host started holding its three standard streams alone
Why: D231 starts shards api-run through std's Command, which hands it what another thread of its orchestrator holds inheritable at that moment: on macOS std's posix_spawn passes no POSIX_SPAWN_CLOEXEC_DEFAULT while macOS's pipe, socket, socketpair and accept take no close-on-exec flag; on Windows std's CreateProcessW inherits with no handle list. image/spawn.rs starts it through posix_spawn with file actions for 0, 1 and 2 (CLOEXEC_DEFAULT on Apple's) and through CreateProcessW with a PROC_THREAD_ATTRIBUTE_HANDLE_LIST of its three stdio handles alone, so an orchestrator (Hex) can boot images on macOS and Windows (Hex joint plan step 12, Ada 2026-11-12).

